--[[
SERENITY HUB — BREAK AND STEAL AN EGG
Production readable integration V1
Core movement priority:
Demon Event -> Steal -> Break -> Treadmill
This production controller preserves the validated V30 treadmill/steal/guard/re-steal/base
engine and adds one central scheduler, Serenity V3 controls, filtered target ranking,
interruptible egg breaking, and the already validated API-only utility workers.
Break and Demon Event are conservative/default-OFF because their final combined
scheduler path still benefits from live event testing. Stable validated mechanics are
kept intact and revalidated before action.
]]
